28.3464566929133888 742.6774015748030706 Td
(RENTORA PROJECT OVERVIEW) Tj
T* (Escrow Process with Admin Review) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (RENT ESCROW PROCESS \(3-STAGE WITH ADMIN REVIEW\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Stage 1: Payment Received \(HELD Status\)) Tj
T* (• Tenant/student pays rent, agent fee, and caution fee to the platform) Tj
T* (• Payment status set to 'held' \(in escrow\)) Tj
T* (• Admin receives detailed notification email with: payment breakdown, agent name, property details,) Tj
T* (student name, reason code: PAYMENT_RECEIVED, timestamp) Tj
T* (• Funds are held securely on the platform) Tj
T* (• Agent balance: NOT UPDATED YET) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Stage 2: Move-In Reported) Tj
T* (• Agent confirms keys handed over to tenant/student) Tj
T* (• Payment status changed to 'move_in_reported') Tj
T* (• Admin receives notification email with: move-in confirmation, agent name, property details, student) Tj
T* (name, reason code: MOVE_IN_REPORTED, timestamp) Tj
T* (• Funds still held in escrow) Tj
T* (• Agent balance: NOT UPDATED YET) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Stage 3: Admin Reviews & Releases Payment) Tj
T* (• Admin reviews the payment transaction in the dashboard) Tj
T* (• After verification \(fraud checks, documentation review\), admin approves release) Tj
T* (• Payment status changed to 'released') Tj
T* (• FULL AMOUNT credited to agent balance: Agent fee \(10% of rent\) + Rent amount + Caution fee) Tj
T* (• Admin receives final notification email with: RELEASED status, full breakdown of amounts credited,) Tj
T* (agent name and updated balance, property details, student name, reason code:) Tj
T* (PAYMENT_RELEASED, admin who approved, timestamp) Tj
T* (• Agent can now withdraw the credited amount) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (ADMIN EMAIL NOTIFICATIONS - DETAILED SPECIFICATION) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Email triggers at three key points:) Tj
T* (1. Payment Received \(HELD\) - Initial notification) Tj
T* (2. Move-In Reported - Status update) Tj
T* (3. Payment Released - Final action completed) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Each email includes:) Tj
T* (• Transaction ID) Tj
T* (• Agent Name & ID) Tj
T* (• Student/Tenant Name) Tj
T* (• Property Address) Tj
T* (• Payment Breakdown \(Rent Amount, Agent Fee 10%, Caution Fee\)) Tj
T* (• Current Payment Status) Tj
T* (• Reason Code \(PAYMENT_RECEIVED | MOVE_IN_REPORTED | PAYMENT_RELEASED\)) Tj
T* (• Timestamp \(ISO 8601 format\)) Tj
T* (• Admin action required \(if any\)) Tj
T* (• Link to transaction in admin dashboard) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (ANTI-FRAUD PROTECTIONS) Tj
T* (• All funds held on platform \(not directly transferred\)) Tj
T* (• Admin manual review before agent receives payment) Tj
T* (• Full audit trail of all transactions) Tj
T* (• Email notifications provide transparency) Tj
T* (• Timestamps and reason codes enable fraud detection) Tj
T* (• Agent cannot withdraw until admin approves release) Tj
ET
